{
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 3.5,
   "end": 8.108,
   "text": "The cabin I rented had an old rotary phone on the kitchen wall."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 8.708,
   "end": 12.868,
   "text": "Its cord had been cut. It just hung there... like a dead tail."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 13.668,
   "end": 17.209,
   "text": "The guestbook had one rule, underlined twice."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 17.809,
   "end": 23.015,
   "text": "If the phone rings, don't answer it. And never say your name inside this cabin."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 23.915,
   "end": 28.352,
   "text": "The first night was perfect. Snow. Firewood. Total silence."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 29.252,
   "end": 32.281,
   "text": "Then, at three in the morning... it rang."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 34.881,
   "end": 39.809,
   "text": "That old metal bell shook the whole wall. Twelve times. Then it stopped."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 41.009,
   "end": 45.297,
   "text": "And from the dark kitchen, very quietly... someone picked it up."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 46.697,
   "end": 50.495,
   "text": "A man's voice said, Yes. She's here. She's asleep."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 51.495,
   "end": 55.633,
   "text": "Footsteps crossed the floor. My bedroom door creaked open."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 57.033,
   "end": 60.831,
   "text": "He leaned over my bed and whispered... What's your name?"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 62.631,
   "end": 66.407,
   "text": "I didn't answer. I didn't breathe. At dawn, he was gone."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 67.407,
   "end": 72.847,
   "text": "I packed fast. On my way out, I signed the guestbook... out of habit. My full name."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 74.247,
   "end": 79.687,
   "text": "That night, at home, my phone started ringing. The caller I.D. just said... Cabin."
  }
 ],
